OL,3,GNEWSA'We're nervous of parking apps,'
OL,4,Asay older drivers
OL,5,
OL,6,FOlder drivers have admitted to feeling
OL,7,F"extremely nervous" of using cashless
OL,8,Fcar parks out of fear they will be hit
OL,9,Fwith a parking charge or scammed.
OL,11,FThey voiced their concerns to the BBC
OL,12,Fafter Roland Nice, 89, from Bury St
OL,13,FEdmunds, in Suffolk, was handed a #60
OL,14,Ffine after being left confused over how
OL,15,Fto pay to park.
OL,17,FHe is one of millions of people who
OL,18,Fsuffer a similar fate each year.
OL,19,FAccording to the RAC, a record 16.9
OL,20,Fmillion parking charges were issued by
OL,21,Fprivate companies in 2025/26.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
