OL,3,GNEWSA'We're nervous of parking apps,'
OL,4,Asay older drivers
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile not all of those fines were a
OL,7,Fresult of mature motorists' struggle
OL,8,Fwith technology, many of the region's
OL,9,Fmore senior citizens do feel the
OL,10,Fdigital divide is widening.
